            % between calls to the System object`,isInputSizeMutableImplSummary:`Return false if input size cannot change
            % between calls to the System object`,isInactivePropertyImplSummary:`Return false if property is visible based on object 
            % configuration, for the command line and System block dialog`},simulinkExtensionSysObj:{summary:"Add summary here",note:`NOTE: When renaming the class, the file name and constructor name
