            % internal or discrete states.`,resetImplSummary:"Initialize / reset internal or discrete states",backupRestoreFunctions:"Backup/restore functions",saveObjectImplSummary:"Set properties in structure s to values in object obj",setPublicPropState:"Set public properties and states",setPrivateProtectedProp:"Set private and protected properties",loadObjectImplSummary:"Set properties in object obj to values in structure s",simulinkFunctions:"Simulink functions",getDiscreteStateImplSummary:"Return structure of properties with DiscreteState attribute",isInputSizeMutableImplSummary:`Return false if input size cannot change
            % between calls to the System object`,getOutputSizeImplSummary:"Return size for each output port",getOutputSizeImplExample:"Example: inherit size from first input port",getIconImplSummary:"Define icon for System block",useClassName:"Use class name",getIconImplExample1:"Example: text icon",getIconImplExample2:"Example: multi-line text icon",getIconImplExample3:"Example: image file icon",simulinkCustomizationFunctions:"Simulink customization functions",getHeaderImplSummary:"Define header panel for System block dialog",getPropertyGroupsImplSummary:"Define property section(s) for System block dialog"},liveTaskClass:{classSummary:`% Add summary here

