    % class.`,commentForUIElements:"% Declare UI elements here",statePropComment:"% State property stores current state of UI objects in the task, specified as a struct.",summaryPropComment:"% Task summary, specified as a string scalar or character vector.",setupMethodComment:`% Method to set up the initial state of the task.
            % This method is called when the task is constructed.
            % Add your implementation here`,generateCodeMethodComment:`% Method to generate code and outputs for the task.
